  "remarks": "LLC Morskoy Standart-Bunker is a shipping company based in Russia that specialises in providing technical support. The company is the technical manager of the vessels Protey, Peley and Arno Babajanyan. Those vessels lack adequate liability insurance and engage in manipulation of Automatic Identification Systems while transporting crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia. Therefore, LLC Morskoy Standart-Bunker manages vessels that transport crude oil or petroleum products exported from Russia and practice irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organization General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
